Z||000009||gixxer||12-04-2000||11:18 PM||||Red, I don't have the Design One kit installed yet, but I can read the numbers right off the turbo for you, since it's sitting in my lap.<BR>It's an IHI RHB5 with an integral waste gate.<BR>Turbo Spec:5T 550 9906<BR>Serial Number:RHB503003A<BR>Parts No:III25-4016 <BR>The Design One kit has a surge valve located on the compressor outlet pipe, looping back to the compressor inlet pipe.<BR>Hope this helps.||||reg||1
