Z||000027||Slammed Fiero||12-14-2000||05:30 PM||||In answer to ArmandoP's question there is a design one / Miller woods car up here in Canada owned By race tech running a internally stock 2.8 , 4spd tranny , intercooler , turbonetics deltagate .Blow off valve ect.<P>Car is running 10lbs of boost last I heard it was running 13.2's<P>Ouch.<P><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...||||reg||1
Z||000028||rogergarrison||12-14-2000||05:37 PM||||i have 3.1 out of a Z-24, built a little with a AirResearch turbo. I run about 4.5 pnds boost usually (have dialed it up higher on occasion), and have put about 40,000 miles since installed with no motor probs. Quick ques for u other turbos, i found out when weather turned lot colder here, i had to readjust wastegate to keep from overboosting. I fly planes so I understand air density/temp. anyone else have to do this, i drive my car year round, just not on snow n ice.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556367"> ||||reg||1
Z||000029||Xtreme Fiero's||12-15-2000||07:41 PM|||| My first Fiero was a Turbo '84 SE withs a auto. I bought the car used from a dealer and over the next 1000 miles I blew 3 head gasket due to the lack of boost control, I also burnt the hell out of the turbo unit it self because I never let it spool down. as for the cold weather question I allwase noticed that when it was cold out I had a engine knock. long story short I had a MINT 1984 Fiero SE with 55k miles I payed $3500 for with a very very blown motor. though I still have the car it is no longer turbo charged nor a V6 so I don't think I can be #6 on your list.<P><BR>Sory i'm upset now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||9
